msgid "Semihosting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/semihosting.rst:17
msgid ""
"Semihosting is a mechanism that enables code running on the target device to "
"communicate and use the Input/Output of the host computer."
msgstr ""

